Name: dav1d is an AV1 decoder :)
Short Name: dav1d
URL: https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d
Version: master
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: BSD-2-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
CPEPrefix: cpe:/a:videolan:dav1d
Source: https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d

--[ DESCRIPTION ] ------------------
This contains the source to the dav1d video decoder; used for AV1 decoding in
Chromium. This copy was taken from the webrtc checkout of chromium (chromium webrtc).
The LICENSE file is copied from libdav1d/COPYING.


--[ UPDATING ] ------------------
This repository should be updated by taking a clean snapshot from the webrtc checkout
of chromium. Details on how to obtain webrtc can be found here:
https://webrtc.github.io/webrtc-org/native-code/development/

